{"last_link_id": 26, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [394.75872802734375, 435.5741882324219], "pos": [1499.013427734375, 328.8745422363281], "widgets_values": ["### 第一部分：创意内容描述 (Creative Content Brief)\n\n| 标题 | 内容 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **项目名称** | 兰蔻小黑瓶精华换妆品广告分镜 |\n| **分镜总格数** | 6格 (2行 x 3列) |\n| **总体风格** | 黑白、高对比度、手绘线稿，具有电影大片感 |\n\n**【分镜图内容列表 (Shot List)】**\n\n| 编号 | 画面描述 (Visual/Action) | 镜头/景别 (Shot Type) | 旁白/对话/文字 (Narration/Text) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | 开场画面：一片浩瀚的宇宙背景，星云和光点交织，画面中心有一滴晶莹剔透的液滴悬浮。 | 超远景 (Extreme Wide Shot) | 无 |\n| 2 | 液滴缓缓掉落，镜头跟随液滴下落，画面中逐渐显现兰蔻小黑瓶精华瓶身，瓶身在光晕中隐约可见。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | 无 |\n| 3 | 瓶身特写：镜头聚焦于小黑瓶的正面，瓶身晶莹剔透，光线从瓶内射出，光影交错。 | 特写 (Close-up) | 无 |\n| 4 | 使用场景切换：一位优雅女性在镜子前使用兰蔻小黑瓶，轻轻涂抹在脸上，表情自信愉悦。 | 中近景 (Medium Close-up) | 无 |\n| 5 | 女性的肌肤特写：肌肤纹理细腻，光滑透亮，展现产品功效。 | 特写 (Close-up) | 无 |\n| 6 | 结束画面：纯白背景中，兰蔻小黑瓶静置，瓶身清晰，文字“LANCÔME - ADVANCED GÉNIFIQUE”清楚可见，光晕环绕。 | 静物特写 (Still Close-up) | 无 |\n\n---\n\n### 第二部分：生成的黑白分镜图 (Generated Storyboard)\n\n**【提示生成指令 (Prompt for Image Generation)】**：\n\n\"Create a 6-panel storyboard in a 2x3 layout, showcasing the cinematic advertisement for Lancôme Advanced Génifique serum. The style should be high-contrast black-and-white ink sketch, with clear and dynamic hand-drawn lines. Each panel should maintain the integrity of the product's proportions, bottle shape, and packaging details. The tone is cinematic and luxurious.\"\n\n1. **Panel 1 (Extreme Wide Shot):** A cosmic background with nebulae and stars, featuring a single droplet of liquid suspended in the middle. The droplet glows softly.\n2. **Panel 2 (Medium Shot):** The droplet falls slowly, revealing the silhouette of the Lancôme serum bottle in the background. Soft light emanates from behind the bottle.\n3. **Panel 3 (Close-Up):** A detailed close-up of the serum bottle, showing its logo and intricate glass texture. Bright light streams through the bottle.\n4. **Panel 4 (Medium Close-Up):** A graceful woman applying the serum on her face in front of a mirror, her expression serene and confident.\n5. **Panel 5 (Close-Up):** A detailed view of the woman's smooth, radiant skin, emphasizing the product's effectiveness. Light accentuates her flawless skin texture.\n6. **Panel 6 (Still Close-Up):** The Lancôme serum bottle is centered on a pure white background with glowing light around it. The logo and text \"LANCÔME - ADVANCED GÉNIFIQUE\" are clearly visible."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 3, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "p0", "links": [16], "label": "p0", "type": "*", "localized_name": "p0"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [381.28167724609375, 688.863525390625], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "pwd"}, "name": "pwd", "label": "pwd", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "pwd"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "RHHiddenNodes", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RHHiddenNodes", "info": "", "ref_info": "Z0FBQUFBQm85TjR1Ui1GbV9uWTdPM19sSTJtZFdwRlktM0ZxbU4zN2ZIU2pMQ21jdkRIcTdRdmdnUS05RmduRXhqWnJZS05qanl6X0tuWS1GQkp5MWEwS2hUTWd4MFJnUmc9PQ=="}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [5], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [281.0086975097656, 1153.798828125], "widgets_values": ["\"Create a 12-panel storyboard in black and white ink sketch style. Each panel should depict scenes featuring a Toyota Sienna car in various settings, maintaining high contrast and dynamic comic book line art style. Use pure black, white, and gray shading. Arrange the storyboard in a 3x4 grid format. \n\n1. Panel 1: Show a close-up of the front of the Toyota Sienna with a cityscape in the blurred background. Sunlight reflects off the car's logo.  \n2. Panel 2: Depict the Sienna driving through a bustling urban street, surrounded by tall buildings reflecting sunlight.  \n3. Panel 3: Show the car crossing a bridge with a river and the city skyline visible in the distance.  \n4. Panel 4: Illustrate the Sienna navigating a winding mountain road, surrounded by trees.  \n5. Panel 5: Close-up of the car's wheels driving through a muddy path, emphasizing its strong grip.  \n6. Panel 6: Sienna driving through a rainy scene, raindrops sliding off the windows, headlights glowing in the rain.  \n7. Panel 7: Interior view of the car with a happy family enjoying the ride, smiling and talking.  \n8. Panel 8: Show the open trunk of the Sienna, packed with various luggage, showcasing its spaciousness.  \n9. Panel 9: Illustrate the car driving through a desert landscape, kicking up dust behind it.  \n10. Panel 10: Sienna parked atop a mountain, surrounded by nature, with a beautiful sunset in the background.  \n11. Panel 11: Sienna driving through a vibrant city at night, neon lights reflecting off the car's exterior.  \n12. Panel 12: Close-up of the Toyota Sienna logo on a white background with the tagline 'Sienna, Drive Your Life' written below in bold.\""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 17, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [21], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [400, 240], "pos": [855.4595947265625, 1081.287353515625], "widgets_values": ["", 1234749661, "randomize", "16:9"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 25, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"sha